   "source": [
    "# CarDekho Used Car Price Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "**Problem type:** Regression  \n",
    "**Target:** `selling_price`\n",
    "\n",
    "This version keeps the project readable while fixing the important issues:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Categorical EDA includes both `object` and `category` dtypes.\n",
    "2. A `DummyRegressor(strategy=\"median\")` baseline is included.\n",
    "3. Raw-target and log-target modeling are compared using **cross-validation on the training set**.\n",
    "4. The test set is used only once after the target strategy and model are selected.\n",
    "5. Dataset loading works in Colab through normal paths or an upload prompt.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Workflow\n",
    "EDA → cleaning → feature engineering → train/test split → preprocessing → baseline models →\n",
    "cross-validation → tuning → raw-vs-log target CV comparison → final test → dummy baseline → save model.\n"
   ]
  },
